        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 6:43AM AKDT until September 27 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Coastal waters forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...S wind 25 kt. Seas 13 ft. Widespread rain showers.
.TONIGHT...SW wind 30 kt. Seas 15 ft.
.SUN...SW wind 25 kt. Seas 15 ft.
.SUN NIGHT...W wind 25 kt. Seas 12 ft.
.MON...W wind 30 kt. Seas 9 ft.
.TUE...W wind 25 kt. Seas 8 ft.
.WED...W wind 15 kt. Seas 8 ft.
</description>
